BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (ownership [ehSkuiHT060 @ 00:05:21]. Lien Ledger repeats the industry claim of more than 95 percent, then backs it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (with Washington, D.C.'s ten-year review of 9,395 properties: 70 percent redeemed, 16 percent canceled, 13 percent still) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (in progress, and just 1 percent ended in foreclosure, concluding that a lien investor is basically a lender [H9fPhqUYPfc) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (@ 00:03:33]. Tax Sale Secrets says liens are meant to pay off and that foreclosure is the more unusual outcome, though) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (a necessary part of making the system work [fIPCLCdZlAU @ 00:02:07]. Invest with Wesley explains who actually) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (lands on the delinquency list: owners who finally paid off a mortgage and lost the escrow account that used to cover) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (their taxes, and heirs who inherited a house without realizing the tax bill came with it. Both groups usually pay or sell,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (and a sale pays the lien before the mortgage [n7l4w1FaXS4 @ 00:03:12]. The shared operator conclusion: underwrite) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (every certificate as an interest trade first, and treat any house that falls out of it as the rare exception.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (Priority is the third pillar. Tax Lien Code walks the lien stack: a mortgage, then a home equity line of credit, then a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (contractor's mechanic's lien normally get paid first in, first out, but the county ignores that order and drops its tax lien) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (into first position over everybody [h-Q6weCN110 @ 00:03:33]. Saen Higgins goes further, calling the tax lien a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (phantom lien that has always sat on the parcel and pops up the moment taxes go unpaid; if the owner does not redeem) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (in time, the buyer steps into the county's position and every other lien and encumbrance, including the mortgage, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (second and the IRS, becomes junior [G44d74hIS_0 @ 00:05:45]. Tax Sale Secrets adds that this first-position status) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (blocks any sale or refinance until the lien is cleared and is exactly what hands the holder foreclosure power) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm ([fIPCLCdZlAU @ 00:04:21]. The baseline prerequisite every speaker repeats is local homework. Bill Miller warns that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (each county runs its own auction rules, delinquency dates and redemption timelines, and that once the redemption) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm (period lapses the investor typically has to drive the foreclosure, ideally with an attorney guiding the process) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.80 Tm ([PRTEvlETNdk @ 00:04:09]. Nobody in this group treats the rules as uniform across the country; the county is the unit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.57 Tm (of research, and the state statute sets the boundaries.) Tj ET
