BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (and experienced bidders pre-rank targets and set automated maximums so the plan executes when attention fades) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm ([TL6AIsoe5m0 @ 00:18:18]. They also flag Florida's cash clock: 10% at the auction and the balance within 48 hours,) Tj ET
