BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 344.62 Tm (channel [GxMaS0YFT1Y @ 00:46:21] names useless land the biggest risk, avoids anything under 0.1 acre, and says to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.40 Tm (call the HOA before buying. Dustin Hahn [eJhR4GkZ7Qo @ 00:05:11] floats a buy-for-about-$50k,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 314.17 Tm (build-for-about-$800k play on the Coconino parcel, but only after verifying the land is buildable, its hazards and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 298.95 Tm (restrictions, and a Google Maps check. Government liens found through court records are the second trap: Tax Sale) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 283.72 Tm (Secrets plans around the 120-day IRS window on IRS liens but treats city and state liens as payoffs, and Skyler warns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 268.50 Tm (Florida HOAs may try to collect from the new owner even after a mostly free-and-clear deed purchase. Flood layers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 253.27 Tm (need reading, not glancing: one Tax Sale Academy demo confirmed zone X rather than AE, while All Things Spatial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 238.05 Tm (flags a zone AE floodway hit on a Livonia parcel and notes the official determination is a separate document.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 222.82 Tm (The economics checks are where cheap paper turns into dead money. Tax Sale Secrets [GxMaS0YFT1Y @ 00:29:04]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 207.60 Tm (warns that counties will never refund a buyer, buyer beware, and that their one dispute in 20 years was settled by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.37 Tm (deeding the property back; the same masterclass says to re-check the county list because properties redeem right before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 177.15 Tm (the sale, budget about one year of holding costs such as $100 to $150 weed cutting, and stick to the max bid. On liens,) Tj ET
