BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 146.70 Tm (foreclosure cost as a big one, that redemption happens 95 plus percent of the time, that roll-up risk concentrates in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 131.47 Tm (Arizona and Florida, and that an unpurchased 2019 lien on a $9.2M property is a caution flag. Platform mechanics bite) Tj ET
