BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 573.77 Tm (Time is the bleed nobody prices in. Ted Thomas bought a tax-defaulted property online with a credit card for $140,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 558.55 Tm (and planned a $350,000 to $400,000 exit. Real estate dropped substantially the following winter, and they ultimately) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 543.32 Tm (sold at $280,000. That sale came only after a retiring judge spent 13 months of diligent work getting the quiet title) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 528.10 Tm (issued. Buyers could not get a mortgage until the title cleared. So Thomas ate 13 months of taxes, heat, cleaning,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 512.87 Tm (landscaping, snow removal, and security bills on an ownership period they did not want [O8MWhOJE6Oc @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 497.65 Tm (00:07:42]. Casey Dimmon flags where those months hide: an attorney who lets the file sit on the desk for a month or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 482.42 Tm (longer, 30 to 45 day defendant response windows, and court systems backed up eight months or even a year before a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 467.20 Tm (judge sees the case. The investor carries maintenance the whole time [7BP12s9Jn2c @ 00:13:14]. Ted Thomas's own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 451.97 Tm (baseline for a normal quiet title is three to six months and $3,000 to $5,000 [MzL0xEaYnUI @ 00:01:31]. Darren) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 436.75 Tm (Findlay quotes about 120 days, and a $1,400 flat fee plus costs, only on procedural tax-reversion files. They warn that) Tj ET
